WEBVTT

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.230
The ancient seal has been broken.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:22.430
In the past, you buried all of the land with misfortune.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:28.570
A legendary Horror that even forced the emperor

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.560
to move the location of his capital!

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.370
Wake now from your long slumber.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.790
Go!

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:49.730
Possess new feelings of darkness and bring disaster upon the capital!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:13.970
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:21.960
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:29.160
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:38.230
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:47.580
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:55.380
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:01:55.380 --> 00:02:03.300
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:13.320
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:19.480
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:23.990
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:29.000
"LURKING DEMON"

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:34.000
My! How lucky! How lucky!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.030
I've always thought that wares from a monk were all rubbish.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:43.040
Who knew I would find such a hidden gem from them!

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.310
You call that a hidden gem?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.880
You made us come with you to the run-down market of Touji temple

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:51.210
for an entire day just to buy that little bauble.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:54.980
It's just a shell of a river snail.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:00.990
Normal shells of river snails whorl out clockwise.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.420
But, this snail shell...?

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.860
Wh-Whorls out counterclockwise?

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:07.100
I'm glad you understand.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.830
We don't!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.200
Though they are such insignificant creatures,

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:16.270
this one rebelled against the way of the world.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.710
Such a brave soul!

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.840
Oh, sorry!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.780
Huh? Huh?

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.220
I-It's been stolen!

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.850
--Huh?
--Both of you! Chase after that river snail!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:32.950
Huh?!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.480
--Okay.
--Why us?!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.250
He's a fast one!

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:54.740
You chose the wrong targets.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:58.240
Did you think you could get away from me?

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:00.980
Whoa there!

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.050
You don't know when to give up!

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.580
Now, give me back what's mine!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.590
How dare you do that to my little servant!

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:12.090
Huh? Did you call for me?

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.160
I'm not talking about you!

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:14.460
Now, give it up!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.730
Shit! Let me go!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:22.440
These are persimmon seeds in the shape of <i>magatama.</i>

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.810
A <i>tsuchinoko</i> that's been impaled by a bull-headed shrike!

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.640
Scabs from a bear!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.810
The hand of a <i>kappa</i>!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.510
Bastard! You have a good eye.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:33.680
What's the point of complimenting him?!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.320
You may have the river snail!

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:38.590
In exchange, g-give me this!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.180
You're going to trade?!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.130
Is that you, Gobeh?

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.530
Mum!

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:54.470
Um, did Gobeh do something?

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:59.310
The shadow of death is over her...

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.210
She doesn't have long.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.280
He steals for the sake of his mother, huh?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.120
I'm weak to those kind of situations.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.850
However, the items he stole were all rubbish.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.490
Is that a complaint toward me?

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:18.360
Not everyone loves strange things like you.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:22.560
Though he dirties his young hands, he cannot save his mother.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.760
You just have to accept some things as fate.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:29.200
Or...

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:33.310
Can you go around and give charity to all the people here?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:39.150
And that one called Gobeh may be more sly than you think.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.920
What do you mean?

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:45.410
He has too many stolen goods for a child to sell on his own.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.220
Don't joke around!

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:54.600
You're telling us that your tribute is a measly river snail?!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:58.400
This is a rare river snail shell that whorls out counterclockwise.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:01.040
It's a treasure that cannot be replaced.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.600
Are you making fun of us, you shitty brat?!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:10.010
Stop!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:17.190
Gobeh, give it up.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.550
Boss.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:23.420
You can't become one of us.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:25.390
Why?! Even I...

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:28.730
We don't just steal anything we come across.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:34.570
We hate the aristocrats.
We want to cause them trouble.

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:37.240
Can you do something like that?

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.610
And you're a goofy one.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.040
Huh?

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:44.950
Yasusuke!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.950
I have thrown away that name.

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.620
My name is Hakamadare now.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.990
Hakamadare? You?!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.590
Oh? You've heard rumors of me in the capital?

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:56.320
So you were serious!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.490
You really became a thief!

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:04.400
Didn't I tell you? In this world, the criminals are the sane ones.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.770
As I thought, this has to do with the disappearance of Kosode.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:13.810
Don't ever say that name again!

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:19.280
Gobeh, if you really want,
I will give you one more chance.

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.250
I don't care if it's their <i>shaku</i> or <i>eboshi</i> hat.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.180
Go and steal something from an aristocrat.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:32.360
The boss got mad at me because of you guys!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:36.030
Why are you trying to become one of them?

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:39.700
It's to help my mum, of course!

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:43.100
Do you think your mom would be happy if you became a thief?

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.270
She would!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.610
Of course she'd be happy if she stopped being sick!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.510
If she feels better, she'll be able to produce milk.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.950
If my sister could drink milk, she'd laugh!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.680
If my little sister laughed, mum would feel even better!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:03.060
Boss Hakamadare is amazing!
He has food, clothes, and even medicine!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.960
Gobeh.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.960
Sis.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.300
You've mistaken the one you should follow under.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.490
Huh?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:20.310
Sis! I swiped a raccoon-skinned potpourri satchet!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.470
Oh! Good work!

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:28.680
Yes, the fact that it smells even without anything in it is nice!

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.920
Here! Your reward.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.020
Sis! A mermaid tail!

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:37.530
Good work! This obvious fakeness is wonderful!

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.750
Sis! A charred corpse doll of some sort from the city of magic!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:44.530
Ooh! The cryptic wind-up motions are so fun!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.700
Sis! A rattle drum!

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:49.670
Oh, that's boring.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.670
It's popular among aristocrats with too much time.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:52.610
A silly object.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.010
Unforgivable.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.510
In the end, she's having him steal!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.910
Well, it's better than him joining a crew of bandits.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:02.520
And it seems he is receiving rewards properly.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.890
I believe this is
Seimei's way of helping others.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.890
Committing crimes to help people.

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:14.360
Helping people by supporting crime.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.730
Are things like this really okay?!

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:18.430
Ouch!

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:30.110
I don't know how to thank you.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.450
I really appreciate everything you are doing.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.880
It's nothing.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:37.610
Gobeh is working under a lady of such status.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.790
I'm embarrassed to say this,

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.990
but Gobeh has a habit of collecting strange things.

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:47.480
He is very useful.

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:50.630
I see.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:54.640
How are things? Are you able to eat a little better now?

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.000
Thanks to you.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:00.630
I never thought I'd be able to eat rice porridge in my lifetime.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.580
Now. There, there.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:12.650
I know that my body doesn't have much time left.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.520
I believe that to be the will of heaven.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:20.360
No matter how much I struggle, my life is reaching its end...

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.530
No!

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.700
The will of heaven?!

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:35.140
I don't want to die! No, I can't die yet!

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:42.480
I would rather live in this hellish world than leave my children!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.180
I do not want to die!

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:52.190
It's true!

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.060
When I got up to take a piss last night,

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.300
there were red flames in the sky!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.470
I got it. I got it.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:01.160
Why won't you believe me?!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.640
--Dad...
--Hey!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:10.340
Da...

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.050
Boy! Boy!

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:19.920
--Mum! Blood... Blood!
--Help me. My throat. My throat! It burns!

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.020
This is...

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.900
A plague?

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:32.030
In the Western slums of Ukyo.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:34.040
Small pox or malaria?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.770
It is a disease we have never seen before.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:41.540
The infected vomit blood and their throats burn until their death soon after.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:47.050
It seems we must close the gates of the Light Palace for a while.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:51.390
We should transfer the sick to the Rajou Gate.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.390
To the Rajou Gate?

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:55.720
They will die, either way.

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:59.360
It is a way to prevent the sickness from spreading.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.920
I see. Reasonable.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:13.310
There, there. So noisy.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.150
"Rajou Gate"

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:53.640
It seems no one has ever returned alive from there.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.910
They do such terrible things.

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:58.310
You want to go, no matter what?

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:02.150
I gotta stay next to Mum.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:05.240
I'm the only one who can protect my little sis and Mum.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.660
I found this at the medicine shop in Touji.

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:14.430
This is from us.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.330
I hope you can at least escape hunger this way.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:23.300
Thanks.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.740
Well, then.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.850
Goodness. Such a stubborn child.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.010
I don't know.

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:03.880
What do you mean, you don't know?!

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:08.020
You're telling me someone like you doesn't know if this is the work of a Horror?

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.780
I didn't say that.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:13.190
You suddenly barged in so enthusiastically that I teased you.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.890
The seal of the Itsumaden has been broken.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:20.800
It is a Horror that loves plagues.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:26.330
Disaster creates darkness. Envy. Rebellion.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:31.010
Or perhaps, attaching oneself too much to this world.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.470
Please wait.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:36.880
The weakness in a human heart creates the darkness that lures a Horror.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:42.580
On the other hand, wanting to live should strengthen the human soul.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.150
So, why?!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.550
There is a limit to everything.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:52.090
In the past, the Itsumaden appeared alongside an epidemic in the South.

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:58.690
At that time, the Horror possessed a human who wanted to live at any cost.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:03.740
The one possessed by the Itsumaden

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:08.280
spread disease until the South fell to ruin.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:11.410
As a last resort, the Makai Knights at the time sealed it away

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.380
under the Crying Snake Mound.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:20.890
Epidemics lure the Itsumaden.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:25.860
It must be destroyed before it's too late!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:30.260
Otherwise, this capital will meet the same fate as the South.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.370
Mum!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.070
Gobeh...

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.710
Why are you here?

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.940
Hey! Here's another one!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:46.950
Come!

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:48.420
What are you doing to Mum?!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.650
Shut up!

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:50.920
Gobeh!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.420
How could you do that?!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.820
Hurry up and stand!

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.120
No, stop. Please give her back!

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.960
G-Give me back my baby!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:03.820
Give her back!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.930
I won't die.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:13.510
No matter where I go.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.500
I will not die!

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:29.180
Slowly. Drink it slowly.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:38.270
Sis Seimei gave me this medicine.
It should knock out that epidemic!

00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:42.370
So Mum, please cheer up!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.930
I'll make some rice porridge. Just wait!

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:49.840
Such a cute child.

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:53.980
The baby on his back, even more so.

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:55.040
Who are you?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:07.700
Stop!

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:11.730
We will not allow anyone to pass!

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:13.390
Beautiful women can pass.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.210
Yes. Beautiful women can pass.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.080
Mum.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:25.980
Hang in there, Mum!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:31.190
--I want to live! I want to live!
--That's right. You'll live, Mum!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:36.860
As you say, there is nothing after death.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.860
Not even darkness.

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:45.210
R-Rather than becoming nothingness,
I'd rather become darkness!

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:54.510
Kintoki, is the will to live a strength or a weakness?

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:55.910
Isn't it a strength?

00:17:55.910 --> 00:18:00.280
To give up living.
Is it a strength or a weakness?

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:01.920
Isn't it a weakness?

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:04.890
That's right. I believe that as well.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.420
However...

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:09.020
Let us see for ourselves.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.620
That answer.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.260
Mum...

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:19.370
Darkness over nothingness. Such splendid words.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:25.070
I must live on for my children.

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:30.140
Then accept the darkness.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:39.720
Hey. There, there. Hey, hey.

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:45.150
Rattle rattle! Rattle rattle!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.800
There ya go!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.390
Rattle rattle!

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.000
Gobeh will...

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.740
What's wrong? Accept it.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.400
Thank goodness.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.750
Accept the darkness!

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:06.970
Everyone!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:26.430
Seimei!

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.860
All right!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:41.710
Raiko!

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:43.780
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.340
Bro!

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:28.610
Damn. How long does
Gobeh plan on making us wait?!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.730
Forget it. Leave him alone.

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:44.840
Hey, Seimei.

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:46.470
What?

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:50.070
Can there be strength in giving up your life?

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:53.440
Who knows.

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:06.250
I don't understand such convoluted matters.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:38.130
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:45.070
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:52.240
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:59.180
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:02.750
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.220
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.660
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:48.390
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:51.030 --> 00:24:01.050
"Next Episode: MOTHER DAUGHTER"

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.750
Read the moon and see the world.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:57.250
Follow the darkness and hunt the demons.

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.080
The true intent of each lies there.
